{"_meta":{"com.oxinsider/docs-group":"markets","securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["read"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get Edge Hunter"},"description":"Read the Max-only Edge Hunter API at https://0xinsider.com/sports/edge. Pro receives 403 forbidden with reason max_plan_required. One view selector offers board (default), full signals and cohort observations. All views accept kind sports|esports (omission covers both), sports, leagues, market_types, condition_ids, event_slugs, series_slugs and legacy category. Array selections accept 1..100 supplied values before deduplication, including comma-separated values inside a value; repeat REST query keys or supply MCP arrays. Lists match OR; axes match AND. Canonical sports and machine league identities normalize case-insensitively; market types and event/series slugs are exact case-sensitive provider strings. category=NFL selects the Football bucket; leagues=[nfl] selects NFL. Selection precedes the cap or pagination and appears as normalized selection beside the result fields; changed selections cannot share cursors or ETags. Every row carries nullable market_context with nullable league, series_slug, market_type and metadata_updated_at for authoritative filter discovery; metadata_updated_at is the local canonical writer clock, not provider observation time. Selected reads fail closed with 503 read_model_warming if frozen sidecar readiness is absent. Board defaults stay B grade floor, 30 rows and 48-hour horizon; min_grade S/A/B and limit clamp 1..30 are configurable, total is before the cap, with both current outcome quotes. Signals use min_grade default B, horizon default 12/clamp 1..48, limit default 20/clamp 1..100 and cursor, retaining token_id, all ranked/holder/directional/category-skill fields and clocks. Grade floor requires a holder at that grade or better without removing other holders. Observations require cohort wider_holder|in_play|emerging_pile, accept limit/cursor, and retain full observation rows, snapshot_as_of, degraded, source-generation/category funnel diagnostics and REST meta. With cohort wider_holder, admission most_held_48h opts in to the most-held selection instead: per sport, up to 8 wider_holder markets kicking off within 48 hours, most graded holders first, then volume, then soonest kickoff, at most 4 per event, recomputed every refresh and not held; every row's admitted_by is most_held_48h, the response echoes admission, and its funnel, coverage and degradation describe that selection. Required degradation_reasons names each cause with its canonical sport or null for a generation-wide cause. Degradation and coverage input_markets/capacity_limited_markets/emitted_observations/incomplete_holder_markets describe the whole all-sports generation and remain unchanged by selectors. coverage.selected_observations counts matching selected cohort rows before pagination; returned_observations counts this page. Intentional capacity_limited admission does not itself degrade a snapshot, and pagination cannot recover excluded markets. not_configured upcoming supply is not a provider failure. A selected funnel with no failure terminals does not prove the shared generation healthy. A legacy category value that cannot resolve to a sport retains its zero-work empty result: all six counts are zero and reasons are empty without reading the all-sports snapshot, so those values do not establish its health. Observation horizon stays 48h with 12h in-play kickoff lookback and 30s live snapshot ceiling; after one missed refresh, observations serve the last snapshot up to 45s longer with its age in meta.cache_age_s, and a second miss in a row returns 503; funnel accounting is not a league/type/ID selection census. All public views read warmed generations only; missing or stale readiness returns 503 read_model_warming with Retry-After 5. Advanced views use private,no-cache with REST/SDK ETag/304 helpers; board uses private,no-store and has no ETag/pagination. Invalid mode-specific parameters return 400. Price marks are market midpoints, not wallet entry prices; volume is shares. Null/db_only/degraded identify unavailable or weaker evidence. Analytics is not an order instruction.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"admission":{"description":"Observations with cohort wider_holder only: the most-held selection, up to 8 markets per sport within 48 hours, recomputed every refresh. Omit for the default selection","enum":["most_held_48h"],"type":"string"},"category":{"description":"All views; legacy canonical bucket alias. NFL selects Football; use leagues=[nfl] for NFL only.","type":"string"},"cohort":{"description":"Required for observations; rejected for board/signals","enum":["wider_holder","in_play","emerging_pile"],"type":"string"},"condition_ids":{"description":"Exact market selections. Raw provider condition IDs and the existing mkt_-prefixed aliases normalize to raw IDs. Unknown well-formed IDs return an empty result. All views. Repeat this query key or put comma-separated values inside a value. Values normalize, sort and deduplicate; at most 100 supplied values before deduplication. Values within this axis match OR; different selected axes match AND. An empty selection is invalid. Filtering precedes the board cap or advanced pagination and is bound to advanced cursors and ETags.","items":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":100,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"cursor":{"description":"Advanced next_cursor, bound to view, all normalized selections and snapshot","type":"string"},"event_slugs":{"description":"Exact provider event slugs. Use event_slug returned on the row; no title or slug-prefix guessing. All views. Repeat this query key or put comma-separated values inside a value. Values normalize, sort and deduplicate; at most 100 supplied values before deduplication. Values within this axis match OR; different selected axes match AND. An empty selection is invalid. Filtering precedes the board cap or advanced pagination and is bound to advanced cursors and ETags.","items":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":100,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"horizon_hours":{"description":"Board default 48/signals default 12, clamp 1..48; rejected for observations","type":"integer"},"kind":{"description":"All views: sports excludes the Esports bucket; esports selects only Esports. Omit for both. Combines with other selections using AND. Selected reads echo normalized selection and require frozen metadata readiness.","enum":["sports","esports"],"type":"string"},"leagues":{"description":"Normalized machine/provider league identities, such as nfl, cfb, nba, epl, cs2, lol, dota2 or valorant. Known wire/tag aliases normalize; other provider keys match exact lowercase identity. This is separate from category: category=NFL selects Football, while leagues=nfl selects NFL only. Read market_context.league for authoritative values. All views. Repeat this query key or put comma-separated values inside a value. Values normalize, sort and deduplicate; at most 100 supplied values before deduplication. Values within this axis match OR; different selected axes match AND. An empty selection is invalid. Filtering precedes the board cap or advanced pagination and is bound to advanced cursors and ETags.","items":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":100,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"limit":{"description":"Board cap default 30/clamp 1..30; advanced page default 20/clamp 1..100","type":"integer"},"market_types":{"description":"Exact provider sports_market_type values. This is an open provider taxonomy, distinct from exact market IDs. Read market_context.market_type; missing selected metadata excludes the row. All views. Repeat this query key or put comma-separated values inside a value. Values normalize, sort and deduplicate; at most 100 supplied values before deduplication. Values within this axis match OR; different selected axes match AND. An empty selection is invalid. Filtering precedes the board cap or advanced pagination and is bound to advanced cursors and ETags.","items":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":100,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"min_grade":{"description":"Board/signals only; holder at this grade or better, default B","enum":["S","A","B"],"type":"string"},"series_slugs":{"description":"Exact provider series slugs. Read market_context.series_slug; a missing selected series excludes the row. All views. Repeat this query key or put comma-separated values inside a value. Values normalize, sort and deduplicate; at most 100 supplied values before deduplication. Values within this axis match OR; different selected axes match AND. An empty selection is invalid. Filtering precedes the board cap or advanced pagination and is bound to advanced cursors and ETags.","items":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":100,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"sports":{"description":"Canonical sport buckets, including Esports and Table Tennis, matched case-insensitively. Unknown names and league aliases such as NFL are rejected in sports; use category for legacy bucket aliases or leagues for exact league selection. Omission covers every sport admitted by the selected view. All views. Repeat this query key or put comma-separated values inside a value. Values normalize, sort and deduplicate; at most 100 supplied values before deduplication. Values within this axis match OR; different selected axes match AND. An empty selection is invalid. Filtering precedes the board cap or advanced pagination and is bound to advanced cursors and ETags.","items":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":100,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"view":{"default":"board","description":"Response mode; defaults to board","enum":["board","signals","observations"],"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"get_edge_hunter","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"EdgeHunterBoard":{"properties":{"as_of":{"format"